---
import RoundedGrid from "../assets/RoundedGrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
<div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16">
<div class="prose prose-blockquote:border-l-white prose-a:text-indigo-400 hover:prose-a:text-white prose-headings:font-normal prose-headings:text-white prose-li:marker:text-indigo-500 text-vulcan-300 prose-code:text-white prose-blockquote:text-white/70 max-w-none">
<h2>
        RESULT 
      </h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <h3>Operational Efficiency and Seamless Integration:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>
                <h3>Hours of Manual Work Saved:</h3>
                <p>The integration between the third-party gift card system, Heartland Retail POS, and Shopify Plus eliminated the need for manual tracking and syncing of gift card balances. This saved Solstice’s team significant time and reduced the risk of errors, freeing up resources to focus on more strategic initiatives.</p>
            </li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Growth in Key Business Metrics:</h3>
            <ul>
            <li>
                <h3>Increased Annual Recurring Revenue (ARR):</h3>
                <p>By running targeted gift card and promotional card campaigns, Solstice saw a 12% increase in ARR, driven by both initial purchases and follow-up redemption efforts.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <h3>Higher Customer Lifetime Value (LTV):</h3>
                <p>Linking gift cards to customer profiles allowed Solstice to better understand their customers’ behavior and preferences, resulting in more personalized offers and a 15% boost in LTV.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <h3>Boosted Average Order Value (AOV):</h3>
                <p>The “Spend $X, Get $X” promotions encouraged customers to spend more to reach reward thresholds, resulting in a 10% increase in AOV during promotional periods.</p>
            </li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Improved Customer Retention and Repeat Purchases:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>
                <h3>20% Increase in Repeat Purchases:</h3>
                <p>The combination of gift card promotions and loyalty rewards led to a 20% increase in repeat purchases. Customers who received promotional gift cards were more likely to return to use them, and Solstice’s ability to follow up on unredeemed cards further enhanced this trend.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Customer Engagement and Fun:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>
                <h3>Engaging and Fun Campaigns:</h3>
                <p>The flexibility of the gift card system allowed Solstice to create engaging and fun promotional campaigns that resonated with their customer base. Seasonal promotions, flash sales, and time-sensitive offers helped keep customers excited and coming back for more.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <h3>Customer Satisfaction:</h3>
                <p>Customers enjoyed the convenience of using gift cards across both in-store and online channels, leading to an 18% increase in customer satisfaction scores.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ol>
</div>  
</section>
<section class="relative border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16">
  <div
      class="prose prose-blockquote:border-l-white prose-a:text-indigo-400 hover:prose-a:text-white prose-headings:font-normal prose-headings:text-white prose-li:marker:text-indigo-500 text-vulcan-300 prose-code:text-white prose-blockquote:text-white/70 max-w-none">
<h2>
  CONCLUSION 
</h2>
<p>
  By implementing a third-party gift card management solution that seamlessly integrated with Heartland Retail POS and Shopify Plus, Solstice was able to automate and streamline its promotional gift card system, saving hours of manual work and driving significant growth in key metrics. Their ability to link gift cards to customer profiles and run cross-channel promotional campaigns resulted in increased ARR, LTV, and AOV, while simultaneously boosting customer retention and satisfaction. The new system allowed Solstice to reward their best customers, have fun with promotions, and create a truly omnichannel shopping experience.
</p>
</div>
</div>

</section>

